			shape: "square"
			dependencies: ["8B0905B72719884C"]
			description: [
				"&7At the &eSpell Binding Table&7 you bind &eSpell Scrolls&7 to a &eSpell Book&7 for levels and lapis. Hold the book in your offhand and its spells join your weapon's spells."
